OL,3,GNEWSADrug rape killer should never have
OL,4,Abeen freed, says victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drugged multiple women over a
OL,7,F40-year period and eventually killed
OL,8,Fhis partner should never have been
OL,9,Freleased from prison, according to one
OL,10,Fof his victims.
OL,12,FRichard Scatchard was jailed twice but
OL,13,Freleased from prison on licence in
OL,14,F2013.
OL,16,FHe went on to kill Kelly Faiers in
OL,17,F2023, by coercing her into taking
OL,18,Fsleeping tablets after drinking
OL,19,Falcohol.
